WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.530
- So I got a really funny comment

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:03.220
on Twitter that I think is worth sharing.

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.600
By the way, the handle on
Twitter is now @legaleagle.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.710
I got the main handle on Twitter,

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:08.543
I think that's great.

00:00:08.543 --> 00:00:09.780
But here's the comment I got.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:10.690
If I've learned anything

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:14.050
from Legal Eagle it's to
not email anyone ever.

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:17.380
Yeah so I would never tell
you to do anything illegal,

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.740
but if you are going to
do something illegal,

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.560
you should not put it in an email

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:23.470
or in the case of Matt gates, don't put it

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:25.200
in your Venmo history.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.680
The bread and butter of litigation

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:30.300
these days is calling
over hundreds of thousands

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.510
of electronic documents,
whether it's emails or files

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:36.910
on the computer and the
documents don't tend to lie.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:40.250
So yeah, if you're worried
about committing some sort

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:44.003
of crime, don't put it in an
email or I'll see you in court.

